Limine -> Memory
Memory -> Scheduler
Scheduler -> Syscalls
Syscalls -> VFS
VFS -> NYFS
Kernel -> Graphics
Graphics -> Compositor
Fonts -> Compositor
Compositor -> UI
UI -> Explorer
Explorer -> VFS
Kernel -> PS3
Loader -> PPU
